00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:21.760
What?

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:23.760
You like it?

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.180
Like it?

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:28.600
Yeah, I do.

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:31.020
I like it, too!

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:31.980
You do?

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:33.060
Yup!

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:35.230
Looks so warm...

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:35.980
Yeah...

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:43.950
Water for table number 3, please!

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:45.830
O-Okay!

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.670
H-Hiroshi! What's wrong?!

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:03.680
H-He's... drunk!

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.260
Idiot!

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:07.890
Hiroshi can't drink a drop of alcohol!

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:09.390
Who made him drink?

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:13.440
Um... I... gave him water...

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:15.440
How would he get drunk on water?!

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:20.900
Missy! This is water! I asked you for vodka!

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:21.990
What?!

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:24.280
Hey, hey, hey!

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.660
What are you gonna do about this, little girl?

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:32.870
Hiroshi here is a valuable Pod pilot for our "Team Skull"!

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:34.250
Skull!

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:36.210
Bones?

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:41.340
How are we supposed to compete in today's
Pod Battle with him sloshed like this?

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.470
Well? Well?

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:56.650
Inspector Wong.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:01.570
We're ready to mobilize. Right away, if need be.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.370
Commissioner Steiger...

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:21.050
it's already been fourteen years since your father passed away.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:26.800
He taught me everything I needed to know to be a police officer.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:31.140
The unit can be dispatched at any time.

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:33.680
We'll stand by until ordered.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:40.270
I respected Commissioner Steiger...

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.190
More than anyone else.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:46.030
Thank you very much.

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:04.590
Okay, listen up.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:10.600
To win, you've got twenty minutes to hold down the other Pod, or push them over the line.

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:14.890
If time runs out, the winner is
determined by the battle data.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:17.350
Attacks on the cockpit are against the rules.

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:19.560
The other fishermen were talking.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:23.820
They say you're pretty good. I'm counting on you.

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:26.360
I'll work enough to make up
for that glass of vodka, okay?

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:29.860
That's the spirit!

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:33.580
The second battle will start now.

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:36.370
Team Chappy vs. Team Amano.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:38.500
Hey, when is Kurau's battle?

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.330
The battle pods are entering the arena!

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:41.750
Let's see... Team Skull is...

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:43.880
In the red corner, Prairie D!

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:45.340
Oh, here it is... the third battle.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.380
In the blue corner, Naoki!

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:46.840
Hey.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:47.550
Oh, it's Doug.

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:48.170
Yo!

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:51.300
Ready... Go!

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:53.930
Are you worried, Christmas?

00:06:56.140 --> 00:07:00.060
Yeah... I wonder if it hurts when you get hit.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:04.020
Well, I'm sure you'll feel it a bit.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.150
It's all my fault...

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:12.200
Don't worry. This is nothing for Kurau.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.870
Easy as pie!

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.160
Easy as pie...

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:22.000
Next, the third battle.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:25.040
Team Z's Shark Head vs.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.340
Team Skull's Hiroshi the Anarchy.

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:28.550
Team Skull's Hiroshi the Anarchy.
 It's finally her turn.

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:28.840
The battle pods are entering the arena!
It's finally her turn.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:28.960
The battle pods are entering the arena!

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:29.920
The battle pods are entering the arena!
Kurau...

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:30.970
The battle pods are entering the arena!
Don't call her Kurau. She's supposed to be Hiroshi.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.760
In the red corner, Team Z's Shark Head!
Don't call her Kurau. She's supposed to be Hiroshi.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:34.390
In the red corner, Team Z's Shark Head!

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:36.260
In the red corner, Team Z's Shark Head!
Hiroshi...

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:45.440
In the blue corner, Team Skull's Hiroshi the Anarchy!

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:48.650
That's Kura... I mean, Hiroshi?

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:52.240
Battle Pods! Ready! Go!

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.670
Too bad we can't just end it like this.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:07.550
Kurau!

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:14.760
Oh, so close.

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:28.020
Kurau's awesome!

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:29.020
Yeah, she's good.

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:30.860
Kurau!

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:36.740
Am I near the line?

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:50.000
What's the big idea, grabbing me all of a sudden?! That's dangerous!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.600
What?!

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:10.110
All right!

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:17.910
If that's how you wanna play,
then I'm not holding back either!

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:20.200
Go!

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.120
Get him!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.750
Right there, to your right!

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:24.910
Kurau... Kurau...

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:25.870
Kurau...

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:28.000
Kurau, you can do it!

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:56.650
Christmas...

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:58.320
What an awful name.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:13.710
It's snowing! It's snowing!

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:15.380
14 Years Ago
- Earth-

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.380
Papa! Mama!

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:19.930
Wow... Snow on Christmas Day...

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:22.470
This is your first time, isn't it, Ayaka?

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:23.180
Yeah!

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:25.350
Snow on Christmas Day...

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:27.980
Couple this with an all-night stakeout

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:32.520
and you've got the makings
of a sad story from my young days...

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:35.480
Come on, Dear... Not that story again!

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:38.280
You get embarrassed so easily!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.700
Hey, can I go outside and look?

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:43.490
You can see the snow from inside.

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:46.040
No, I want to see our house.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.160
I want to see our house shining in the snow.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:50.460
It's going to be cold, you know.

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:53.210
I'm okay. I know just the place.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:57.090
Don't be long. The party's about to start.

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:58.170
Okay!

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:19.360
Whoa...

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:38.380
it's so beautiful...

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:44.090
Huh?

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:07.430
Papa?

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:09.430
Mama?

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:00.060
Papa...

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:02.070
Mama...

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:52.410
I just got a call...

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:57.120
The people who killed your father, mother,
and brother have been arrested.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:04.090
Assistant Director! What were the criminals after?

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:05.880
It's under investigation.

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:08.800
It's reported that this was a robbery attempt

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:11.220
and not a crime by an anti-establishment
organization as initially rumored.

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:12.590
It's under investigation.

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:17.350
Is it true that a member of the GPO was involved?

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:18.520
Assistant Director!

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:20.560
It's under investigation!

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:22.940
Come on, Assistant Director...

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:11.070
That day... I don't know why I decided to go to that house.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:15.200
Maybe I needed closure...

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:17.200
Like that would ever happen...

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:29.670
All I knew was that my Papa, Mama and Brother were no longer in this house...

00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:32.420
The only thing left was...

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:40.470
I heard voices ridiculing me...
That's how it felt...

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:43.390
It still hasn't left this house.

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:44.770
That's...

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:09.130
Venom, I thought.

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:13.970
Venom lingers on in this house and refuses to leave.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:19.810
That venom... is staring me in the face.

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:22.930
That's how I felt.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:40.830
So this is the cream of the crop?

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:42.910
What's up? You need something?

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:45.660
No, just had some extra shooting passes.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:46.710
Who's that?

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:48.630
Huh? Oh, yeah...

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:51.460
That's Ayaka Steiger. She's new to the academy.

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:52.500
Steiger?

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:58.430
So you're the former commissioner's daughter?

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:01.050
Please don't call me Steiger.

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:06.730
You trying to shoot someone?

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:08.350
Man, you got that look.

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:11.860
Think of them as targets or you'll never hit them.

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:17.610
Well, good luck.

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:51.310
Get 'em! Right there!

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:52.020
Kurau! Kurau!

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:53.480
Take him down!
Kurau! Kurau!

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:56.990
Hell yeah!

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.530
Go!

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:18.380
Foul on Hiroshi the Anarchy's fighter for attacking the cockpit.

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:23.600
Winner! Shark Head!

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:29.270
Prepping

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:27.220
Cheers!

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:29.270
Cheers!

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:33.440
it's a shame you didn't win,
but still it was a fun match.

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:35.360
Good job, Kurau.

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:37.190
Yeah, I guess...

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:40.110
But I did mess up.

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:42.360
You should've been there, Mom.

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:42.860
But I had a great time.

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:44.700
Yeah, I wish I could've seen it.

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:43.570
What?

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:46.240
I was so nervous watching you.

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:49.580
Mom may not look it, but she used to be the Queen of Pod Battle.

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:48.080
You were so cool.

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:49.830
Wow, that's awesome.

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:51.370
Wow, that's awesome.
Thanks.

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:51.750
Wow, that's awesome.

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:10.180
I'm home!

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:12.560
Hey! Don't come in through the restaurant!

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:15.860
Dad, I heard GPO Pods are here on the island.

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:18.570
I wonder if they're going to
be in the next Pod Battle.

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:20.650
Why? Are there a lot of them?

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:23.320
I don't know. I haven't seen them yet.

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:25.320
We're all gonna go look at 'em now.

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:27.830
Hang on there. What about homework?

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:29.200
I'll do it when I get back.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:32.120
You'd better. Be careful now.

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:33.420
Okay!

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:37.380
That report we got about the ship's passenger list...

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:40.960
ls Kurau really ex-officer Doug's traveling companion?

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:46.050
To think that a former GPO member
would help in her escape...

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:48.560
What kind of powers does she have?

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:50.720
Can she fly or something?

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:52.430
Doug...

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:56.400
Stop!

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:03.110
Ayaka!

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:05.410
Hey, Doug!

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:08.660
Kurau!

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:09.780
The GPO is...

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:25.510
Sorry,

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:25.510
I have to go.

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:25.510
I'm grateful to you.

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:23.840
Sorry.

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:25.510
I have to go.

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:27.340
I'm grateful to you.

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:34.100
Damn it!

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:46.950
From a great distance

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:46.950
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:56.290
You smile at me

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:56.290
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:05.420
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:05.420
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:14.520
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:14.520
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:23.730
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:23.730
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:32.870
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:32.870
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

00:22:35.040 --> 00:22:42.000
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:22:35.040 --> 00:22:42.000
Moonlight kakenobori kitto

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:51.090
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:51.090
Moonlight mou ichido aeru

00:22:53.350 --> 00:23:00.310
Moonlight

00:22:53.350 --> 00:23:00.310
Moonlight

