I know I can definitely capture Kurau.

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:16.120
I believe that.

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:16.950
And why is that?

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:20.370
I have a deep hole in my heart...

00:23:20.370 --> 00:23:23.250
